WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.550
Your menu should not live in five

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:02.600
different places.

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:05.380
Old PDF screenshots, QR pages, and shared

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:07.240
menu files can keep showing the wrong

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:07.840
version.

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:09.670
Upload photos of your existing menu, no

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:10.670
typing required.

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:12.330
Menu List prepares a private customer

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:13.280
preview in minutes.

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:15.040
You review before anything goes public.

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:16.590
Then one approved link powers your QR

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:19.160
page, print files, and customer actions.

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:21.180
Menu List, create your customer link.
